    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "041ab88e5818f62d",
      "translationZh": "📋先决条件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "db7818786075ab57",
      "translationZh": "一个存放领域文档的目录（文本文件，格式为 .txt、.md 或类似格式）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "96c9858c6ad89c15",
      "translationZh": "一个有效的 NVIDIA API 密钥（可在 build.nvidia.com 免费获取）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2a9aedf7329a614",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA Ampere 或更新架构的 GPU，显存至少为 80GB（计算能力 >= 8.0）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bd04f6391b185296",
      "translationZh": "本教程已在 1xA100 (80GB) 和 1xH100 (80GB) 上测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e04626891dc7b172",
      "translationZh": "读完本文，你将掌握如何：📄 在没有标注数据的情况下，从领域文档生成训练数据 🎯 利用难负样本挖掘进行有效的对比训练 🔗 通过多跳查询提升嵌入质量 ⚙️ 微调双编码器嵌入模型 📊 评估微调是否改善了检索效果 🚀 在你的流水线中部署微调后的模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b500d949b8fb67c4",
      "translationZh": "⚙️环境设置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86baf3eb3ca78b19",
      "translationZh": "在本教程中，我们将微调基础模型 Llama-Nemotron-Embed-1B-v2——这是一个拥有 10 亿参数的嵌入模型，在质量与推理成本之间取得了平衡。请按照这份设置指南开始操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9749d813de9d89b2",
      "translationZh": "📚 第 1 步：从文档生成训练数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed0015c1c5067fe1",
      "translationZh": "微调嵌入模型需要数千个（查询，相关文档）配对。大多数应用场景都没有现成的此类数据。手动创建这些数据成本高、耗时长，而且往往会受到标注人员对何为“相关”的个人理解所带来的偏差影响。你可以使用 LLM（nvidia/nemotron-3-nano-30b-a3b）读取文档，自动生成高质量的合成问答对，无须手动标注数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c3f15799af503a46",
      "translationZh": "它是如何工作的？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b3c8b993f5fb81a",
      "translationZh": "在后台，这一过程会运行一条由 NeMo Data Designer 驱动的四阶段合成数据生成（SDG）流水线：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "af315c54875e811e",
      "translationZh": "输出是什么样的？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7359f80afc02d29c",
      "translationZh": "源文档片段：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34cd217821bcc315",
      "translationZh": "采用 SXM 外形规格的 H100 GPU，其热设计功耗（TDP）为 700W。散热方案必须在持续工作负载下将结温保持在 83°C 以下。对于每个节点超过 4 个 GPU 的高密度部署，建议采用液冷，因为在标准 2U 机箱配置中，风冷无法散去足够的热量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f41e3b7e86ab5883",
      "translationZh": "生成的问答对：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "246d1df576961baf",
      "translationZh": "注意其中的区别：第一个问题只需简单查找事实。第二个问题则需要多跳因果推理。该流水线会生成这两类问题，并支持配置复杂度级别（2–5）和跳数（1–3）。随后，每个问答对都会接受质量评估，获得相关性、准确性、上下文支持程度和清晰度的分项评分，以及一个总体评分。只有达到阈值的问答对才会被纳入训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0f1509e7ab996c14",
      "translationZh": "⛏️ 第 2 步：挖掘困难负样本（以及它们为何重要）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a4ae85d4c319363",
      "translationZh": "如果只用正样本对（查询 + 正确文档）训练嵌入模型，它会学会区分明显不同的文档，却无法应对棘手的情况——那些看似相关、却并非正确答案的段落。在真实的检索系统中，恰恰是这些貌似匹配的文档会导致错误答案。困难负样本挖掘会找出这些容易混淆的段落，让模型学会区分它们。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8dfccec94be82772",
      "translationZh": "上述命令会自动执行三个子步骤：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d3f73e225ec9f675",
      "translationZh": "2a. 训练集 / 验证集 / 测试集划分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e47447de7878cba4",
      "translationZh": "生成的问答对被划分为训练集（80%）和测试集（20%）。测试集被整理为兼容 BEIR 的基准测试格式，用于步骤 5 中的标准化评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cbb37e804d731c42",
      "translationZh": "2b. 困难负样本挖掘",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8f4358addf96951",
      "translationZh": "使用基础嵌入模型，该流水线执行以下操作：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4c5378ed0d0fc90a",
      "translationZh": "为语料库中的每个查询和每个段落生成嵌入向量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a63c2dd3fd17a925",
      "translationZh": "计算每个查询与所有段落之间的相似度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4c4cbde9491ee932",
      "translationZh": "屏蔽每个查询中已标注为正样本的文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7d6fafe94cae3ab7",
      "translationZh": "应用间隔过滤器：剔除所有得分高于最低正样本得分的 95% 的非正样本文档。这一排除区用于防范假负样本——即那些与正样本极为接近、实际上可能相关的未标注段落。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "706dd4b4928768af",
      "translationZh": "从剩余候选中，选取得分最高的 top-k 个文档作为困难负样本（默认每个查询 5 个）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1eb9a38aba85ebab",
      "translationZh": "结果是：困难负样本是与正样本最相似、但仍安全地低于正样本分数上限的非正样本段落。它们是当前模型认为高度相关、但并非标注答案的段落。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eaa7f04e083ff3d5",
      "translationZh": "其有效原因在于：使用简单负样本（完全不相关的段落）进行训练，无法教会模型新的内容。使用困难负样本进行训练，会迫使模型学习领域中真正重要的细微区别。例如，在医学语料库中，一个关于“2 型糖尿病二甲双胍剂量”的问题，可能会有关于“二甲双胍副作用”或“1 型糖尿病胰岛素剂量”的困难负样本——它们非常相近，但存在关键差异。95% 的边界上限可以防止挖掘器选中与正样本过于接近的段落，因为这些段落实际上可能是正确答案，只是在 SDG 期间没有被标注。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "24b4b73fd7c17856",
      "translationZh": "2c. 多跳展开",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33175b395cd9e6b2",
      "translationZh": "多跳问题会引用多个正样本文档。例如，问题“第 3.2 节中的热管理系统与第 5.1 节所述的功率限制有何关系？”就包含两个正样本段落。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f71c4ee31d03e5e2",
      "translationZh": "展开会为每个（查询，正样本文档）对创建一个训练样本，因此对比损失会分别处理每个正样本。包含 2 个正样本文档的问题会变成 2 个训练样本，每个样本使用相同的困难负样本，但正样本不同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b78cd6992284b45",
      "translationZh": "最终输出是一个可直接用于训练的 JSON 文件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9cd2edd563425ce6",
      "translationZh": "🔍 第 3 步：理解多跳问题及其为何能改进检索",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4fc43f7808fddcbb",
      "translationZh": "标准的嵌入模型微调会为每个段落生成一个问题，并训练模型将两者匹配起来。这种方法适用于简单的事实查询，但真实用户提出的复杂问题往往涉及多个文档或章节。如果模型只见过单跳训练数据，就很难为这些复杂查询检索出所有相关段落。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4bb77d336b6a04b7",
      "translationZh": "SDG 流水线默认生成 1 至 3 跳的问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2135f854bbee552e",
      "translationZh": "1 跳：“H100 SXM 的 TDP 是多少？”——用单个段落即可回答。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1c05bcf1f277bd08",
      "translationZh": "2 跳：“H100 的 TDP 与高密度部署中的冷却需求有什么关系？”——需要关联两个段落中的信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e4990fa41e9d192b",
      "translationZh": "3 跳：“在给定 TDP、冷却约束和机架密度限制的情况下，标准数据中心的一排机架中最多可以部署多少个 H100 GPU？”——需要综合三个段落的信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2493eb232d436d19",
      "translationZh": "每一跳都通过各自的上下文摘要和片段 ID 进行追踪，因此训练数据保留了完整的推理链。展开后（步骤 2c），每个（问题，相关段落）对都会成为一个独立的训练信号，让模型学会这些段落都与该多跳查询相关。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f68c1bcb1911b8f",
      "translationZh": "微调后的模型学会检索上下文相关的文档，而不仅仅是词汇相似的文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c35df5232c745359",
      "translationZh": "🧠 步骤 4：微调嵌入模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f0520046d46d40d9",
      "translationZh": "对比学习的工作原理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf30514f88ff513c",
      "translationZh": "训练采用双编码器架构和对比损失。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "979161b824c69b1e",
      "translationZh": "温度设为 0.02 是刻意采用的激进设置，它会产生非常尖锐的概率分布。这种设置效果很好，因为步骤 2 中的难负样本质量很高：这些段落确实容易混淆，模型需要较强的梯度才能学会区分它们。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "02a58a0ecbb1c699",
      "translationZh": "关键超参数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd066ec1bf1d4485",
      "translationZh": "参数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21b111cbfe6e8fca",
      "translationZh": "默认值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a7525b1492fb848",
      "translationZh": "说明",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a972946739bba49",
      "translationZh": "训练轮数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "007c0cc63b671c9e",
      "translationZh": "默认设置针对小型示例数据集进行了调优；对于真实世界的数据，通常 1–2 个 epoch 就足够，可以避免过拟合。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f033c501afe798cd",
      "translationZh": "学习率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45f600841bc70332",
      "translationZh": "调优：尝试默认值的两倍和一半",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9c6bc6843e3161b",
      "translationZh": "学习率预热步数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72934bad053bcfdd",
      "translationZh": "设置为微调总步数的 5-10%，以获得更好的训练初期稳定性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4dc1d06aa6519b19",
      "translationZh": "全局批次大小",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "963b0312746612e4",
      "translationZh": "每个查询的段落数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "334598b791e74d98",
      "translationZh": "1 个正样本 + 4 个难负样本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f230f0f08a3061eb",
      "translationZh": "检查点保存频率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "918099ce4968cb94",
      "translationZh": "如果配置中省略了 ckpt_every_steps，检查点保存频率会自动设置：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3dc53a346a249439",
      "translationZh": "映射式数据集（长度已知）：默认每个训练轮次保存一次。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "db9f4dc441e215ba",
      "translationZh": "可迭代数据集（长度未知）：默认在训练期间保存两次。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83a48cf6c33e532f",
      "translationZh": "这意味着你可以先用一个小型语料库（50–100 篇文档）快速进行概念验证，之后再扩大规模，无需手动调整检查点设置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "680866767eba89d6",
      "translationZh": "📈 第 5 步：衡量改进效果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba40b859c35bee20",
      "translationZh": "微调真的有帮助吗？让我们运行一次标准化评估，在留出的测试集上比较基础模型与微调后的检查点，看看结果如何：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f993aa25922cdb53",
      "translationZh": "评估使用 BEIR 框架，并在 k = 1、5、10 和 100 时计算四项标准信息检索指标：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "36d2c07ea7aece1e",
      "translationZh": "nDCG@k：排序质量——最好的文档是否排在最前面？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "97df0761cd5eba52",
      "translationZh": "Recall@k：覆盖率——相关文档中有多大比例出现在前 k 个结果中？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "450992b52a8e98dd",
      "translationZh": "Precision@k：准确性——前 k 个结果中有多大比例确实相关？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "650ca92cf6e113cc",
      "translationZh": "MAP@k：所有查询的平均精度均值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b76d51e383bd5bc0",
      "translationZh": "一次成功的微调通常能在不到 1 天的时间内，使 nDCG@10 和 Recall@10 提升 10%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7356fcffd28090b",
      "translationZh": "使用 Retrieval Synthetic NVDocs 的结果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8febaf777b88868e",
      "translationZh": "如果指标没有提升怎么办？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "735a6147dd7a7c53",
      "translationZh": "这条流水线让迭代变得轻松：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "59d859fa909246bc",
      "translationZh": "SDG 中的质量评分偏低？检查文档质量——干净、格式规范的文本能生成更好的合成数据。试试规模更大、能力更强的 LLM。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1cb625145a9d5f6e",
      "translationZh": "训练数据不足？向语料库中添加更多文档，然后重新运行 Stage 0。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4b7775505c932b5e",
      "translationZh": "出现过拟合？默认的 3 个训练轮次是针对小型示例数据集调校的；对于大多数真实场景中的数据，1–2 个训练轮次就足够了。还可以考虑提高质量阈值，只保留最优质的训练样本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e9e7a46eaeb767ad",
      "translationZh": "学习率不合适？试试将默认学习率加倍或减半。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c83031e676fc0f4b",
      "translationZh": "🏆 实际应用成果：Atlassian",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3de33d061392816f",
      "translationZh": "Atlassian 已使用真实企业数据验证了这套方案。他们遵循上述相同阶段，使用单张 NVIDIA A100 80GB GPU，在一个公开的 Jira 数据集上应用这条流水线，对 Llama-Nemotron-Embed-1B-v2 进行了微调。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "178a468a208b74b7",
      "translationZh": "Recall@60 从 0.751 跃升至 0.951，提升了 26.7%。微调后的模型能够在 95.1% 的查询中，将正确文档检索到前 60 条结果之内，而基础模型的这一比例为 75.1%。对于支撑 Jira 搜索的检索系统而言，这直接意味着数百万用户能获得更相关的结果。更多详情请参阅他们的博文《为数百万 Rovo 用户推进语义搜索》。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f5d562c802db5936",
      "translationZh": "🚀 步骤 6：导出与部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d1e43cdee4f89b0",
      "translationZh": "PyTorch 检查点非常适合评估，但用于生产环境时速度太慢。最后两个阶段会转换模型，并通过 API 提供服务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ccbaf3629256e2e9",
      "translationZh": "导出为 ONNX / TensorRT",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96ddadb2d973b0a9",
      "translationZh": "这会将微调后的检查点导出为 ONNX（opset 17）。还可以选择将其编译为 TensorRT 引擎，以实现最大的推理吞吐量，并可为批大小（1–64）和序列长度（3–256）配置优化配置文件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c1f69d25c33043f1",
      "translationZh": "使用 NVIDIA NIM 部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6477aa616f8bcf63",
      "translationZh": "导出的模型部署在 NVIDIA NIM 容器内——这是一个可用于生产环境的推理微服务，提供兼容 OpenAI 的 /v1/embeddings 端点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ceb17216ba786c2",
      "translationZh": "运行后，任何客户端都可以调用它：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd1432db9f0a0ca2",
      "translationZh": "由于 NIM 提供兼容 OpenAI 的 API，你可以将其直接接入任何使用嵌入 API 格式的现有 RAG 流水线，无需更改代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "eac06b5c8ac6a1fe",
      "translationZh": "验证部署准确性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1eb0cf9aee67d47f",
      "translationZh": "该流水线包含一个 NIM 准确性验证步骤，对已部署的端点运行相同的 BEIR 评估：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ea333cc1aeb311b",
      "translationZh": "此步骤可以捕获 ONNX/TensorRT 转换造成的任何准确性损失。在容差范围内匹配的指标（@1 为 0.03，@5+ 为 0.01）会标记为通过；超出转换噪声范围的偏差则会被标记出来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b0a00415e1584a68",
      "translationZh": "整合起来",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "729363a877375b04",
      "translationZh": "完整的嵌入微调流水线可以通过六条命令运行，从原始文档一直到已部署的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f518595a8211efa9",
      "translationZh": "预计时间和资源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de838855e4a6e04e",
      "translationZh": "阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "28889b02f8a56ff6",
      "translationZh": "是否需要 GPU？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ad53da54a0cc4bf",
      "translationZh": "预计用时",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a7525b1492fb848",
      "translationZh": "备注",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12075b2187479709",
      "translationZh": "否（使用 API）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0122",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a83002d9933bbaf",
      "translationZh": "约 1 小时",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9be0ad901b5b5816",
      "translationZh": "取决于语料库大小和 API 速率限制",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0124",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a2e9880ece36469",
      "translationZh": "数据准备",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0125",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "036ac188c0e08631",
      "translationZh": "是（40 GB 显存）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0126",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2801049aace0676",
      "translationZh": "约 5 分钟",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0127",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73b728e0d1026189",
      "translationZh": "在 GPU 上进行困难负样本挖掘",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0128",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e045a5ff234059d3",
      "translationZh": "微调",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0129",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59edde6cf90ad364",
      "translationZh": "是（80 GB 显存）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0130",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "377f8da3bb19bbcd",
      "translationZh": "约 1 小时",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0131",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0da8421546aea90c",
      "translationZh": "取决于数据集大小和训练轮数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0132",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f712a33096ba821",
      "translationZh": "评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0133",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "036ac188c0e08631",
      "translationZh": "是（40 GB 显存）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0134",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2801049aace0676",
      "translationZh": "约 5 分钟",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
